      "content": "idk. it just feels like a lie. i spent my whole life thinking that if i just worked harder, if i just reached this specific height, i’d finally feel \"full.\" or at least like i belonged somewhere. but now that i'm here, the silence is just deafening. i feel like i've finished the book and the last page is just blank. i don't even know what i'm supposed to do with myself now. there's no next step, is there?",
